{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Guide Naginami as they ascend the enigmatic Yora in search of their beloved, Iza. In this 2.5D adventure, utilize the Crimson Thread, to swing, grapple, and pull your way through unique peaks and platforming challenges. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2820280/extras/86a4e16b7879f7bf70b8a25570f52fd3.poster.avif?t=1757300703\" width=600 height=222 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2820280/extras/86a4e16b7879f7bf70b8a25570f52fd3.webm?t=1757300703\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2820280/extras/86a4e16b7879f7bf70b8a25570f52fd3.mp4?t=1757300703\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Encounter a myriad of distinctive creatures, each offering a unique approach to the base thread mechanics providing depth in your traversal options.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cross paths with the six-eared fox, Kit, who weaves memories into the fabric of reality, revealing the bond between Naginami and Iza. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Traverse seven breathtaking peaks rich with symbolism and mystery, where every step forward brings you closer to understanding the profound connections that bind us all.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unearth tales of the lost Ambi as you encounter the seven Goddess Statues at the top of each peak.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2820280/extras/b9486a2c98b4d591ce2fb1398ead9d0f.poster.avif?t=1757300703\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2820280/extras/b9486a2c98b4d591ce2fb1398ead9d0f.webm?t=1757300703\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2820280/extras/b9486a2c98b4d591ce2fb1398ead9d0f.mp4?t=1757300703\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2820280?t=1757300703","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2820280/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1757300703","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2820280/53f4338aded7446e3c0246311bd564c4f3b9c846/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757300703","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2820280/53f4338aded7446e3c0246311bd564c4f3b9c846/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757300703","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h1>The climb starts Oct 1 \u2014 Next Fest Demo</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Naginami and the Crimson Thread</i> joins <strong>Steam Next Fest</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Climb the first two Yora peaks with a\u00a0playable demo  <strong>October 1, 2025</strong>!</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Guide Naginami as they ascend the enigmatic Yora in search of their beloved, Iza. In this 2.5D adventure, utilize the Crimson Thread, to swing, grapple, and pull your way through unique peaks and platforming challenges. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2820280/extras/86a4e16b7879f7bf70b8a25570f52fd3.poster.avif?t=1757300703\" width=600 height=222 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2820280/extras/86a4e16b7879f7bf70b8a25570f52fd3.webm?t=1757300703\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2820280/extras/86a4e16b7879f7bf70b8a25570f52fd3.mp4?t=1757300703\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Encounter a myriad of distinctive creatures, each offering a unique approach to the base thread mechanics providing depth in your traversal options.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cross paths with the six-eared fox, Kit, who weaves memories into the fabric of reality, revealing the bond between Naginami and Iza. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Traverse seven breathtaking peaks rich with symbolism and mystery, where every step forward brings you closer to understanding the profound connections that bind us all.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unearth tales of the lost Ambi as you encounter the seven Goddess Statues at the top of each peak.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2820280/extras/b9486a2c98b4d591ce2fb1398ead9d0f.poster.avif?t=1757300703\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2820280/extras/b9486a2c98b4d591ce2fb1398ead9d0f.webm?t=1757300703\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2820280/extras/b9486a2c98b4d591ce2fb1398ead9d0f.mp4?t=1757300703\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Dynastic Games LLC"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2820280/ee700ca113c1f